WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.700
Ryu rushes toward the waiting Juri.

2
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:01.400
Standing light kick Counter Hits the incoming Rush.

3
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.400
Juri cancels the light-kick hit into Drive Rush and standing medium.

4
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.400
Crouching heavy cancels into heavy Fuhajin.

5
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.950
Heavy Tensenrin finishes the response.
